<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>10 - Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta)</p>
<p>9 - Abel Balbo (Roma)</p>
<p>8 - Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza)</p>
<p>7 - Roberto Mancini (Sampdoria), George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>6 - Gabriel Batistuta (Fiorentina), Oliver Bierhoff (Udinese),</p>
<p>Igor Kolyvanov (Bologna), Marcello Otero (Vicenza), Giuseppe</p>
<p>Signori (Lazio)</p>
<p>5 - Alfredo Aglietti (Napoli), Enrico Chiesa (Parma),</p>
<p>Alessandro Del Piero (Juventus), Youri Djorkaeff (Inter),</p>
<p>Vincenzo Montella (Sampdoria), Luis Oliveira (Fiorentina)</p>
<p>4 - Demetrio Albertini and Roberto Baggio (both Milan), Nicola</p>
<p>Caccia (Napoli), Carmine Gautieri (Perugia), Giampiero Maini</p>
<p>(Vicenza), Paolo Poggi (Udinese), Roberto Muzzi and Sandro</p>
<p>Tovalieri (both Cagliari)</p>
</text>
